<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36606" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰκολουθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>follow,</i> of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς φίλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.10.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				31.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύθοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Pet.</u>
					1.16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJProoem.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>follow, result from,</i> c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				181
			</span></i>; <i>attend,</i> c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔνοια,
				φήμη ἐ. τινί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.5.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.78.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπαινοί τισι κατορθουμένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; esp. of penalties, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πρόστιμά τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>UPZ</u>
					112v10
				</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				5.132
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; also of obligations, <i>fall
			on</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPR</u>
				5.15
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>follow, result,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				58.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.15.4
			</span></i>; also of logical consequences, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα ταῦτα ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.22.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. Polystr.<i><span class="en">
				p.5
			</span></i> W.</div>
